#, python-format
msgid ""
"Dear %(contact)s,\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for choosing Profit Sports Solutions. We completed a service visit at %(site)s on %(date)s, and would greatly appreciate a moment of your time to share your feedback.\n"
"\n"
"%(link)s\n"
"\n"
"Your feedback helps us maintain the standard of service you expect from us.\n"
"\n"
"Best regards,\n"
"Profit Sports Solutions\n"
msgstr ""
"عزيزي %(contact)s،\n"
"\n"
"شكرًا لاختيارك Profit Sports Solutions. لقد أتممنا زيارة صيانة في %(site)s بتاريخ %(date)s، ويسعدنا كثيرًا أن تخصص لحظة من وقتك لمشاركة رأيك.\n"
"\n"
"%(link)s\n"
"\n"
"رأيك يساعدنا على الحفاظ على مستوى الخدمة الذي تتوقعه منا.\n"
"\n"
"مع أطيب التحيات،\n"
"Profit Sports Solutions\n"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Dear %(contact)s,\n"
"\n"
"This confirms our technician is scheduled to visit %(site)s on %(date)s at %(time)s.\n"
"\n"
"If this time doesn't work for you, please contact us to reschedule.\n"
"\n"
"Best regards,\n"
"Profit Sports Solutions\n"
msgstr ""
"عزيزي %(contact)s،\n"
"\n"
"هذا تأكيد بأن فنيّنا مجدول لزيارة %(site)s بتاريخ %(date)s الساعة %(time)s.\n"
"\n"
"إذا كان هذا الوقت غير مناسب لك، يُرجى التواصل معنا لإعادة الجدولة.\n"
"\n"
"مع أطيب التحيات،\n"
"Profit Sports Solutions\n"

